    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d283-f1" n="6" type="source" xml:id="d283-f1-content">
                <p>Secret. Carter wrote “ok J” at the top of the page. The meeting took place in the
                    White House Situation Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d283-f2" n="7" xml:id="d283-f2-content">
                <p>Carter placed a checkmark in the
                    right-hand margin next to this sentence.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d283-f3" n="8" xml:id="d283-f3-content">
                <p>Carter changed the word “or” to “on” in
                    the phrase, “Inter-American Commission or Human Rights Commission,” and placed a
                    checkmark in the right-hand margin next to this sentence.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
